glofoni in 3 puntate; esiste una versione per l'homevideo che dura quasi 6 ore. Piuttosto accurato, dal punto di vista storico-militare, nella descrizione della battaglia, ne rimuove sistematicamente la crudeltà e l'orrore: le morti sono tutte gloriose, pulite, istantanee, così come sono tutti valorosi, nobili e in buona fede sia gli unionisti sia i confederati."},{"id":915292,"translatable_type":"title","translatable_id":57213,"locale":"it","key":"slug","value":"gettysburg"}],"keywords":[{"id":840,"name":"independence","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:52:46.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:52:46.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":57213,"keyword_id":840}},{"id":940,"name":"army","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:53:09.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:53:09.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":57213,"keyword_id":940}},{"id":1028,"name":"battle","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:53:34.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:53:34.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":57213,"keyword_id":1028}},{"id":1154,"name":"american civil war","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:54:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:54:22.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":57213,"keyword_id":1154}},{"id":1293,"name":"civil war","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:55:13.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:55:13.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":57213,"keyword_id":1293}},{"id":5075,"name":"based on true story","created_at":"2023-05-18T12:28:07.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T12:28:07.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":57213,"keyword_id":5075}},{"id":6557,"name":"early america","created_at":"2023-05-18T12:49:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T12:49:20.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":57213,"keyword_id":6557}},{"id":8267,"name":"troops","created_at":"2023-05-18T13:24:50.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T13:24:50.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":57213,"keyword_id":8267}},{"id":11868,"name":"union soldier","created_at":"2024-07-23T03:28:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2024-07-23T03:28:03.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":57213,"keyword_id":11868}},{"id":11869,"name":"confederate